//
// Win32 resources linked into copperline.exe by build.rs (embed-resource).
//
// Resource id 1 is the application icon: the lowest icon id in a binary is the
// one Explorer, the taskbar and the Start menu draw for it. This is the same
// multi-size .ico the window itself loads at runtime, so the file on disk and
// the window it opens agree. It sits beside this script, which is where the
// resource compiler looks first (build.rs names the directory as an include
// path as well, for the toolchains that do not).

1 ICON "copperline.ico"
